  "body": "I love this software, my only gripe is:\n\nIt is hard to see, which photo is currently selected in the file browser (or the film strip, which I don't use). I'm always looking for the small triangle in the lower right corner of the thumbnail.\n\nPlease make the selection more visible, for example use the highlight color as background color of the slide, or draw a frame around the selected slide with the highlight color. Sometimes I stop editing after a while because of this, as it is tiring to look for the slightly different background or the small triangle. I know, that I can change the colors in the settings, but this can not be solved by changing these.\n\nThanks in advance!",
